    "description": {
      "content": "The Cobalt API enables developers to programmatically manage integrations, linked accounts, configurations, events, webhooks, executions, public workflows, and datastores within the Cobalt embedded integration platform. Cobalt helps product and engineering teams build native integrations, deploy them within days, and monetize them with the help of AI agents.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Cobalt Support",
